@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/hanoi#> .
@prefix hanoi: <http://example.org/orexis/hanoi#> .

<> a orexis:StateGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is
<> orexis:beliefsOf :hanoi .    # and whose it is — said here, never by the file's name

#  THE TOWER AS POSED: three disks on peg A, smallest on top. The first state graph, and the
#  only file here the runtime never reloads — from the first boot on, where the disks rest is
#  the agent's belief. The mover is a planner alone, so it takes none of the moves it plans and
#  the tower stays as posed: the plan is its output (#928).

:disk_1 hanoi:on :disk_2 .
:disk_2 hanoi:on :disk_3 .
:disk_3 hanoi:on hanoi:PegA .
